  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Education Development in Kyrgyzstan (2023-2025)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the project is to support the Education and Finance Ministries in implementation of the education policy and pursue the following priorities: (i) Fair and equal access; (ii) Quality assurance in education; and (iii) Effective management and financing&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
